        "prompt": "I'm working in the A2E Suite / Twenty monorepo at /Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite. I need to add a native \"Inbox\" page to `packages/twenty-front`, following the exact conventions of the recently-added Chat/Discussions page (P5.2).\n\nResearch and report (read-only, do NOT edit anything), with file paths + line numbers and key code snippets:\n\n1. The routing: `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/app/routing/utils/createWorkspaceRouteObjects.tsx` — how the Discussions/ChatPage route is registered, the `AppPath` enum member (find it), and how a query param (e.g. `channelId`) is read by the page. Show the exact additions needed to add a new route.\n\n2. The navigation conventions (P1.2): find how nav items / sidebar entries are defined (`NavigationDrawer`, `navigationDrawerItem` or similar), and how a new top-level page is linked. Where is the chat/discussions nav entry? Show the pattern.\n\n3. The page + feature module structure for Chat: list the files under `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/chat/` (or whatever the feature dir is) and `packages/twenty-front/src/pages/...ChatPage.tsx`. Show how the page composes components, how it does data fetching (`useFindManyRecords`/custom resolver hooks), how it uses `AppPath` deep links, and how it handles empty/loading states.\n\n4. Realtime: read `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/realtime/hooks/useRealtimeTopic.ts` and its usage on the chat page, plus any front util that builds a channel topic (e.g. `buildChatChannelTopic`). I need to build the equivalent `buildInboxTopic` for `workspace:<id>:inbox:<userId>` and subscribe. Show the exact hook signature and an example call.\n\n5. Lingui/Linaria conventions: show `msg` usage and `styled` component examples from the chat page, and where translation message IDs live. Also confirm the `~/modules/realtime` vs `@/` alias conventions.\n\n6. Any existing \"notification\" related front code (bell icon, notification preferences settings, unread badge) that I should reuse instead of duplicating. Search `packages/twenty-front/src` for \"notification\".\n\nBe thorough — this is the primary precedent for my implementation.",
